__pycache__/
*.pyc
deploy/*/mimoto-issuers-config.json
deploy/*/vcga/mimoto-issuers-config.json
.certs/
src/issuer/target/
target/
deploy/data/
deploy/*/private_key/
# The local Mimoto overlay (compose.mimoto.yaml): its client keystore, and the empty files its VDR mounts land on.
deploy/*/mimoto/
deploy/*/vdr/templates/mimoto-issuers-config.json
deploy/*/vdr/templates/mimoto-trusted-verifiers.json
deploy/*/vdr/templates/mosip-cbeff.xsd
# An organisation's Background (its paper) is published on its own VDR, never committed: any image under an
# Installation's VDR templates folder. Brand assets (logos) live in vdr/assets/ and are committed.
deploy/*/vdr/templates/**/*.png
deploy/*/vdr/templates/**/*.jpg
deploy/*/vdr/templates/**/*.jpeg
# The print check's font, taken from Debian for the run (scripts/print-check.sh).
deploy/*/vdr/templates/print-check/
*.p12
portal/*.db
src/portal/*.db
*.db
.demo-state/
.DS_Store
.claude/
.venv/
venv/
.nfs*
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.pytest_cache/
